# tally 2.1.8 P54, S6 (the final check, T's s6_hole_same_order_class): WARN-LEGS names the two observations that
# disagree in id order, as S6 names a class's rows: bank[q1] (35.00 PLN) before bank[q2] (30.00 PLN).
# 7167d6b4 named bank[q2] first.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-06-30
  note "T, tally 2.1.8 S6 (#177, #187; P51 reopened): HOLE-SAME names its rows in the order of their ids, and a class joined by two same lines (in two versions) names each of its rows and values. pair: same bank[q2] = bank[q1], written q2 first, named q1 first (fp); three: r3 = r1 and r1 = r2 make one class of three (f3, b3)"

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place box: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input bank: observed
input amt: money PLN
input d15: int
input d20: int

move save[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, d15)
  leg cash from konto to sav amount amt

move tip[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, d20)
  leg cash from box to world amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 900.00 PLN "s"
  d15 = 15 "s"
  d20 = 20 "s"
  opening[konto] = 1050.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"
  opening[box] = 1000.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"

version st_konto
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-02
  covers konto, box
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 950.00 PLN, fulfils: save[2026-03]) "r1"
  bank[q2] = (on: 2026-03-20, kind: transfers, leg cash from box to world amount 30.00 PLN, fulfils: tip[2026-03]) "q2"

version st_sav
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-03
  covers sav
  bank[r2] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 950.00 PLN) "r2"
  bank[r3] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 940.00 PLN) "r3"
  bank[q1] = (on: 2026-03-20, kind: transfers, leg cash from box to world amount 35.00 PLN) "q1"

version join_a
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-04
  same bank[r3] = bank[r1]
  same bank[q2] = bank[q1]

version join_b
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-05
  same bank[r1] = bank[r2]

ask fp: flows(tip, 2026-03)
ask f3: flows(save, 2026-03)
ask b3: bal(sav, 2026-03-31), bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
=== expect
b3: (?"bank[r2] and bank[r3] are one, but the leg at sav differs on 2026-03-15: 950.00 PLN (bank[r2]) and 940.00 PLN (bank[r3])" (bank[r2], bank[r3]), 100.00 PLN)
  cut 2026-06-10
f3: ?"bank[r1], bank[r2] and bank[r3] are one, but the amount of cash differs on 2026-03-15: 950.00 PLN (bank[r1]), 950.00 PLN (bank[r2]) and 940.00 PLN (bank[r3])" (bank[r1], bank[r2], bank[r3])
  cut 2026-06-10
fp: ?"bank[q1] and bank[q2] are one, but the amount of cash differs on 2026-03-20: 35.00 PLN (bank[q1]) and 30.00 PLN (bank[q2])" (bank[q1], bank[q2])
  cut 2026-06-10
warning: WARN-LEGS the two observations of save[2026-03] disagree: bank[r1] (950.00 PLN) and bank[r3] (940.00 PLN)
warning: WARN-LEGS the two observations of tip[2026-03] disagree: bank[q1] (35.00 PLN) and bank[q2] (30.00 PLN)
warning: WARN-NEGATIVE box is below zero from 2026-05-20
warning: WARN-NEGATIVE konto is below zero from 2026-04-15
